From: HG maintainers <hg@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] net: pcs: airoha: recover AN7581 Ethernet HSGMII RX lock

PHY/out-of-band mode does not run the phylink PCS polling timer. Add a
lane-local sleepable health worker for AN7581 Ethernet 2500Base-X only.
Use the SDK six/four signal sampling and 700/100 us CDR sequence, confirm
transient faults, serialize with configuration and cancel before teardown.
Three failed attempts enter a thirty-second cooldown. Healthy checks only
read three registers once per second. Keep PHY, MAC and shared resets,
PON, rate-adaptation, fragmentation and packet forwarding policy intact.

SDK reference: lotusmomo/airoha_sdk at
32b5aa356c2406edef8806aaf75451ff0a5286f2,
linux/arch/arm64/mach-econet/sgmii/air_eth_xsgmii.c,
TMR_SGMII_LINKDN_CB, RX_SigDet_Flag and RX_CDR_RST.

Signed-off-by: HG maintainers <hg@localhost>
